# Map all commit/co-author attribution to the canonical proofagent identity.
# Format: <Display Name> <canonical-email> <commit-email>
# (See `git check-mailmap` and https://git-scm.com/docs/gitmailmap)
#
# Any commit or Co-Authored-By trailer with the noreply@anthropic.com email
# is coalesced to the proofagent account so GitHub's contributors list and
# `git shortlog` show a single contributor.
proofagent <proofagent.ai@gmail.com> <noreply@anthropic.com>
